# No id column: the functional rel is keyed to the fixture row index. Row 1 despawns
# (mentor 3 would read shifted slot 3 = old row 4) — the emitter resolves through the
# hidden fixture-row column instead.
n 6
col cursed bool 0 1 0 0 0 0
rel mentor -1 -1 3 -1 3 0
col dead bool 1 0 0 1 0 0
col nord bool 1 1 1 1 1 1
col trained bool 1 1 1 1 1 1
ja 呪 cursed
ja 師匠 mentor
ja 死 dead
ja 北 nord
ja 訓練 trained
